# Keywords Winston looks for in the titles and abstracts of the daily arXiv listing, one per line.
# Case is ignored and a plural ending is allowed: pulsar matches Pulsars, FRB matches FRBs.
# The words of a phrase may be separated by spaces or hyphens. '#' starts a comment.

pulsar
magnetar
FRB
fast radio burst
turbulence
turbulent
MHD
magnetohydrodynamic
